  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with OSCE on Extra Budgetary Funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coperation agreement with the OSCE on Extrabudgetary funding of OSCE activities, including in the independent institustions and the different OSCE representations in OSCE-states. The contribution will only be used on ODA-eligable activities and countries. The agreement contains thematic and geographical prioritizations.</narrative>
  </description>
